    'import.title':'① Import Log','import.hint':'Supports line-based CEF (Common Event Format), LEEF (Log Event Extended Format), standard Syslog (RFC3164/RFC5424, including rsyslog/journalctl ISO timestamps), FortiGate native key=value logs (no syslog envelope needed), native Cisco IOS (show logging) and H3C Comware (display logbuffer) logs, MikroTik RouterOS logs (remote syslog or /log print export), AWS VPC Flow Logs (default or custom field format), Azure NSG/VNet flow logs (JSON), pfSense filterlog, Palo Alto traffic/threat logs (CSV syslog), web access logs (Apache/nginx combined, IIS W3C), JSON/NDJSON, and Windows Event Log (wevtutil/Event Viewer XML export, binary .evtx not supported). Paste text, upload, or drag & drop a file.','nav.tools_btn':'Switch Tool','nav.tool_network':'Hub','nav.tool_switch':'Switch Analyzer','nav.tool_gen':'Switch Generator','nav.tool_fw':'Firewall Analyzer','nav.tool_ca':'Config Anonymizer','nav.tool_log':'Log Analyzer','import.paste_placeholder':'Paste log content here, or use the upload button below…','import.upload_btn':'Upload File','import.analyze_btn':'Parse & Analyze','import.clear_btn':'Clear','import.file_loaded':'Loaded file: ','import.progress_parsing':'Parsing…','import.progress_analyzing':'Matching threat intel & classifying…','import.progress_rendering':'Rendering results…','import.progress_correlating':'Correlating events…','import.large_file_notice':'File too large ({name}, {lines} lines) — content not shown in the box below, still fully parsed','opt.freqWindow':'Freq window (s):','opt.freqThreshold':'Freq threshold:','opt.scanThreshold':'Scan threshold:','opt.volumeThreshold':'Volume threshold (MB):','opt.chainWindow':'Chain window (min):','opt.gapThreshold':'Gap threshold (min):','opt.chainGroupBy':'Group by:','opt.chainGroupByIp':'IP','opt.chainGroupByUser':'User','opt.geoRiskLabel':'Geo-risk countries:','opt.geoRiskFilter':'Filter countries…',
