    'intel.title':'④ Local Threat-Intel Matching List','intel.hint':'Import public or internal IP/CIDR blocklists (plain text, CSV, or JSON/NDJSON — e.g. Spamhaus DROP, OTX, URLhaus, MISP, ThreatQ, STIX 2 exports). Matching happens locally only — no outbound network calls. Hits are flagged as "Confirmed" high-severity issues.','intel.add_btn':'Upload List','intel.name_placeholder':'List name','intel.date_placeholder':'Intel date (manual)','intel.count_label':'entries','intel.remove_btn':'Remove','intel.empty':'No intel list imported yet','hashintel.title':'Local Hash Threat-Intel Matching List','hashintel.hint':'Import known-malicious file hash lists (plain text, one MD5/SHA1/SHA256 per line, or MalwareBazaar, OTX, MISP, STIX 2 exports). Matching happens locally only. Hits are flagged as "Confirmed" high-severity issues.','hashintel.add_btn':'Upload Hash List','hashintel.name_placeholder':'List name','hashintel.date_placeholder':'Intel date (manual)','hashintel.empty':'No hash list imported yet','cat.knownHashIOC':'Known Malicious File Hash',
