    'guide.title':'⑦ Where to Find Word o\' Known Villains','guide.body':'This tool only matches on yer own ship — never sends nor fetches word from shore.\nCommon public charts (just the purpose, matey — find the true URL on the official dock yerself):\n• Spamhaus DROP/EDROP — known villain netblocks (CIDR)\n• Emerging Threats / Proofpoint compromised-ips — known boarded ships\n• abuse.ch Feodo Tracker / URLhaus / ThreatFox — plague-ship signals\n• FireHOL Level 1 — a chart o\' charts, all rolled into one: https://iplists.firehol.org/files/firehol_level1.netset (plain text, hoist it straight aboard)\n• EmergingThreats Block List: https://rules.emergingthreats.net/fwrules/emerging-Block-IPs.txt (plain text)\n• CINS Army List: https://cinsscore.com/list/ci-badguys.txt (one ship per line)\n• Blocklist.de: https://www.blocklist.de/downloads/export-ips_all.txt (one ship per line)\n• DShield Block List: https://www.dshield.org/block.txt (⚠️ a proper ledger with many columns, not a plain chart — hoisted as-is ye only catch the first column, the harbor\'s start, one ship not the whole fleet. Chart it into proper CIDR afore ye hoist it aboard)\nMost public charts have their own rules (some for personal use only) — check afore ye hoist \'em. Refresh the chart at least once a moon, or it goes stale.',
    'deid.title':'⑧ Hide the Crew\'s True Names','deid.hint':'Swaps IP/hostname/username fer consistent fake names (IPs use the RFC5737 map-room range). Do this after ②④ — once hidden, the fake IPs won\'t match the real blacklist no more.','deid.preserve_last_octet':'Keep the Last Digits o\' the IP','deid.run_btn':'Hide Their Names','deid.download_btn':'Download the Disguised Log','btn.export_map':'Export the Chart, arr!','tip.export_map':'Export the chart o\' mappings: feed it to the Treasure Hider, or bring it back aboard here later, arr!','btn.import_map':'Import the Chart, arr!','tip.import_mapping':'Import an existing treasure chart of mappings, so the same booty always gets the same fake name across ships, arr!','msg.mapping_imported':'{n} old mappings brought aboard, arr!','msg.mapping_import_invalid':'That be a cursed chart, matey! Upload the one this ship or the Treasure Hider be makin, arr!','hint.crossToolMapping':'If this log be the same vessel as yer Treasure Hider haul, export or import the chart to keep names matchin, arr!','deid.stat_replaced':'Swapped','deid.stat_ip':'IP','deid.stat_hostname':'Ship Name','deid.stat_user':'Crew Name','deid.stat_mac':'MAC','deid.stat_bucket_overflow':'Over 254 distinct source IPs be de-identified in the {range} waters (currently {count}), arr! Fake addresses will repeat and might point to the wrong original IP!',
